  "content": "<h1>獨特暗黑精緻版</h1><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark-refined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/modrinth@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Modrinth 上的獨特暗黑精緻版\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark-refined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/curseforge@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"CurseForge 上的獨特暗黑精緻版\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/patreon@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon 上的 amongstreality\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/compact/bmc@2x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee 上的 amongstreality\"></a></p><p>獨特暗黑精緻版是我另一個資源包 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">獨特暗黑</a> 的完全重新設計。</p><p>此資源包為遊戲中每個功能性方塊提供了獨特的材質。部分材質需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a> 才能運作。</p><h2>獨特暗黑精緻版 - Lite 與 Full 版本</h2><p>獨特暗黑精緻版 - Lite 版本可從 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark-refined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark-refined\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> 下載。</p><p>獨特暗黑精緻版 - Full 版本則可從我的 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buy Me a Coffee</a> 頁面下載。</p><blockquote>\n<p>⚠️ <strong>警告：</strong> 此資源包僅可從上述平台下載，並在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252funique-dark-refined%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a> 上有獨立頁面。若在其他平台找到，<strong>請勿從該處下載</strong>，因為那些是未經授權的非官方轉載。下載連結可能導向惡意網站，且下載的內容可能含有病毒。</p>\n</blockquote><p>以下列表顯示了 Lite 和 Full 版本中包含哪些材質，以及哪些材質需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a> 才能正常運作。Lite 版本中未包含的材質也已重新繪製，以符合資源包的藝術風格。</p><h3>✅ Lite 版本包含：</h3><ul>\n<li>工作台</li>\n<li>熔爐</li>\n<li>儲物箱</li>\n<li>預設界伏盒</li>\n<li>鐵砧</li>\n<li>附魔台</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>村民職業變體</li>\n</ul><h3>✅ Full 版本包含（除了 Lite 版本全部內容外，另加）：</h3><ul>\n<li>高爐</li>\n<li>煙燻爐</li>\n<li>陷阱儲物箱</li>\n<li>終界箱</li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>彩色界伏盒</li>\n<li>釀造台</li>\n<li>烽火台</li>\n<li>切石機</li>\n<li>砂輪</li>\n<li>製圖台</li>\n<li>鍛造台</li>\n<li>織布機</li>\n<li>發射器</li>\n<li>投擲器</li>\n<li>合成器</li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n</ul><h3>⚠️ 需要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiGUI</a></h3><ul>\n<li>陷阱儲物箱</li>\n<li>終界箱</li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>彩色界伏盒</li>\n<li>發射器</li>\n<li>投擲器</li>\n<li>村民職業變體</li>\n</ul><h2>在此支持我和我的專案：</h2><p>您可以透過加入 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buy Me a Coffee</a> 的紫水晶等級會員來取得獨特暗黑精緻版的完整版本。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/patreon@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbuymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/amongstrealitys-badges/blob/main/labeled/bmc@3x.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\"></a></p><h2>模組支援</h2><p>您可以在此處 <a href=\"https://github.com/AmongstReality/Unique-Dark-Refined-Issues/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">申請模組支援</a> 或回報現有模組支援的問題。</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apotheosis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apotheosis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-enchanting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apothic Enchanting</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-attributes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apothic Attributes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/apothic-spawners\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apothic Spawners</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fappleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">AppleSkin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252feasy-shulker-boxes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Easy Shulker Boxes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Features</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inmis\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inmis</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252flanguage-reload\" rel=\"nofollow\">Language Reload</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fshulkerboxtooltip\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shulker Box Tooltip</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ftravelersbackpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traveler's Backpack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fyyzs-backpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">yyz's backpack</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fwoodworks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Woodworks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fclayworks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clayworks</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fboatload\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Boatload</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgallery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Gallery</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenvironmental\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Environmental</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcaverns-and-chasms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns &amp; Chasms</a></li>\n</ul><h2>使用條款</h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>版權所有 © Unique Dark Refined</p>\n<p>作者 AmongstReality</p>\n<p>作者在不同平台上的頁面連結：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/c/AmongstReality\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252famongstreality\" rel=\"nofollow\">BuyMeACoffee</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/amongstreality/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fAmongstReality\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252famongstreality%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Planet Minecraft</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>您可以使用我的資產的情況：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在 Modrinth/CurseForge 上的公開整合包中使用。</li>\n<li>若您想為此資源包增添模組支援作為附加元件。如果這麼做，您必須明確標示來源，並附上原始資源包的連結。</li>\n<li>任何對原始資源包的私人修改。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>您<strong>不得</strong>使用我的資產的情況：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在基岩版市集上發行。</li>\n<li>設定付費牆（例如 Patreon）。</li>\n<li>在任何平台上發行原始或修改後的資產。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>資源包在不同平台上的頁面連結：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/unique-dark-refined\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252funique-dark-refined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
